nza (essence)#{3}":[53,53],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Essenza (essence)#{4}":[54,54],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Essenza (essence)#{5}":[55,55],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Essenza (essence)#{6}":[56,56],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Essenza (essence)#{7}":[57,57],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Essenza (essence)#{8}":[58,59],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Persona":[60,68],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Persona#{1}":[62,62],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Persona#{2}":[63,63],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Persona#{3}":[64,64],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Persona#{4}":[65,65],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Persona#{5}":[66,66],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Entry: Persona#{6}":[67,68],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Pages created/updated from this source":[69,73],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Pages created/updated from this source#{1}":[71,71],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Pages created/updated from this source#{2}":[72,73],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest":[74,77],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest#{1}":[76,77],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Raw File":[78,81],"#Source: Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino#Raw File#{1}":[80,81]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Battista Mondin","target":"Battista Mondin","line":13},{"title":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","target":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","line":14},{"title":"Tomismo","target":"Tomismo","line":15},{"title":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","target":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","line":16},{"title":"Persona (Tomismo)","target":"Persona (Tomismo)","line":17},{"title":"Persona (Tomismo)","target":"Persona (Tomismo)","line":71},{"title":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","target":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","line":72},{"title":"essenza-e-attualita-del-tomismo","target":"essenza-e-attualita-del-tomismo","line":76}],"metadata":{"type":"source","title":"Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S. Tommaso d'Aquino","address":"c-000029","created":"2026-07-25","updated":"2026-07-25","tags":["#tomismo","#source","#reference"],"status":"developing","related":["[[Battista Mondin]]","[[San Tommaso d'Aquino]]","[[Tomismo]]","[[Dottrina di Atto e Potenza]]","[[Persona (Tomismo)]]"],"source_type":"book","author":"Battista Mondin","date_published":"n.d.","url":"","confidence":"high","key_claims":["Mondin proposes that the true keystone of Aquinas's whole metaphysical edifice is not merely the real distinction of essence/esse per se, but esse conceived intensively (as actualitas omnium actuum) — a distinct interpretive stance from Gilson, Masnovo, Maritain, Fabro, who treat the real distinction itself as the cardinal doctrine.","Essence's metaphysical function is to limit the (per se infinite) perfection of esse within a being — the limitation is located in essence, not in matter or form, which lets Aquinas explain angelic finitude without positing universal hylomorphism (against Avicebron).","The concept of 'person' (Boethius's rationalis naturae individua substantia) is historically a Christian invention, forged through Trinitarian and Christological disputes, and absent from classical pagan thought, which recognized no absolute value in the individual as such."],"raw_file":".raw/B. Mondin - Dizionario Enciclopedico del Pensiero di S.Tommaso d'Aquino.pdf"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Wiki/sources/mondin-dizionario-tommaso.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"14ob0uh","at":1785014069553},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.03965925,-0.00937246,0.04418113,-0.03430624,-0.05733082,-0.02860694,0.00085038,0.06451634,-0.02381443,0.01730356,-0.03157219,-0.05710209,0.01233199,0.02290153,0.06369962,-0.03566682,0.00477339,0.03317754,-0.06687528,-0.01305174,0.1674165,-0.05239411,-0.0476336,-0.04567885,0.06133736,0.01101402,0.01074422,-0.01503114,0.00141598,-0.17066275,-0.02129426,0.04666901,-0.0168351,0.01288609,-0.00346111,0.01590726,-0.04651312,0.00270081,-0.01946366,0.04600484,0.04591245,0.07800677,-0.01227944,0.00145396,-0.02297211,-0.0082973,-0.01951187,0.03294614,-0.04751422,-0.03844495,-0.07365531,0.02951767,-0.00081929,0.0305247,0.01267086,0.09137364,-0.011289,0.02899717,0.01816712,0.00562367,0.08259097,0.06846176,-0.22705662,0.08963567,0.01156167,0.04429964,-0.02745894,-0.04680499,-0.01328006,-0.05771269,0.04365484,-0.03050969,0.03323198,-0.00022356,0.03293555,-0.03247956,0.01287672,-0.03698557,-0.03614039,0.02916176,0.03499756,0.00906936,-0.04966064,-0.01062373,-0.03338891,0.04462176,0.02113912,-0.00057215,0.01879258,-0.0289805,-0.05601147,-0.0627098,0.07208806,0.05600702,0.02650478,0.05234521,-0.02764638,0.05284687,-0.08022896,0.06947895,-0.01756928,0.01356752,-0.01817011,-0.02643258,0.05435295,0.02206119,0.0068985,-0.10328578,-0.00716505,-0.00612819,-0.00866842,0.00777678,0.00510527,-0.05390663,0.04005417,-0.00722545,0.02579428,-0.05952739,-0.00398926,0.02926858,-0.02280984,0.02748175,0.11365654,0.00093853,-0.02388327,-0.07282864,-0.02044291,0.00441968,-0.00075361,0.00395202,0.02055416,-0.01595319,-0.04346953,0.00483976,0.04041507,0.04434764,-0.00969298,-0.0533342,0.0325427,0.03849512,-0.05182717,-0.06699589,-0.03123553,-0.03314938,-0.040281